<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Raspberry Pi Pico on 孤筝の温暖小家</title><link>https://www.guzhengsvt.cn/zh-cn/tags/raspberry-pi-pico/</link><description>Recent content from 孤筝の温暖小家</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>lvbowen040427@163.com (孤筝)</managingEditor><webMaster>lvbowen040427@163.com (孤筝)</webMaster><copyright>本博客所有文章除特别声明外，均采用 BY-NC-SA 许可协议。转载请注明出处！</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 20:10:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.guzhengsvt.cn/zh-cn/tags/raspberry-pi-pico/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MicroPython函数库</title><link>https://www.guzhengsvt.cn/zh-cn/post/code/micropython%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%BA%93/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 Feb 2024 11:44:33 +0800</pubDate><author>lvbowen040427@163.com (孤筝)</author><guid>https://www.guzhengsvt.cn/zh-cn/post/code/micropython%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%BA%93/</guid><description>
<![CDATA[<h1>MicroPython函数库</h1><p>作者：孤筝（lvbowen040427@163.com）</p>
        
          <p>本文整理 MicroPython 的 <code>machine</code> 模块在 Raspberry Pi Pico（RP2040）上的常用接口。内容已对照 <a href="https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/machine.html">MicroPython 官方文档</a> 核对。</p>
<h2 id="machine与硬件相关的功能">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#machine%e4%b8%8e%e7%a1%ac%e4%bb%b6%e7%9b%b8%e5%85%b3%e7%9a%84%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd"></a>
machine：与硬件相关的功能
</h2><p>引脚编号有以下两种：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>GPIO 编号</strong>（GP0–GP29）：代码里最常用，<code>Pin(25)</code> 就是 GP25。</li>
<li><strong>物理引脚号</strong>：开发板上的 40 个针脚位置，与 GPIO 编号不是一回事，接线时要注意区分。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="pin-类">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pin-%e7%b1%bb"></a>
Pin 类
</h3><h4 id="构造函数-machinepinid-mode-1-pull-1-valuenone">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%9e%84%e9%80%a0%e5%87%bd%e6%95%b0-machinepinid-mode-1-pull-1-valuenone"></a>
构造函数 <code>machine.Pin(id, mode=-1, pull=-1, value=None)</code>
</h4><table>
	<thead>
			<tr>
					<th>参数</th>
					<th>说明</th>
			</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
			<tr>
					<td><code>id</code></td>
					<td>引脚编号。Pico 上可用 0–29（GP0–GP29）</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>mode</code></td>
					<td><code>None</code> / <code>Pin.IN</code>(0) / <code>Pin.OUT</code>(1) / <code>Pin.OPEN_DRAIN</code>(2)</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>pull</code></td>
					<td>内部上下拉电阻，<strong>仅在输入模式有效</strong>：<code>None</code> / <code>Pin.PULL_UP</code>(1) / <code>Pin.PULL_DOWN</code>(2)</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>value</code></td>
					<td>仅输出/开漏模式有效，初始电平：0 低电平，1 高电平</td>
			</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p>注意是 <code>Pin.PULL_DOWN</code>，不是 <code>Pin.DOWN</code>。</p>
</blockquote>
<h4 id="pininitmode-1-pull-1-valuenone">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pininitmode-1-pull-1-valuenone"></a>
<code>Pin.init(mode=-1, pull=-1, value=None)</code>
</h4><p>重新初始化引脚。只修改传入的参数，其余状态保持不变。</p>
<h4 id="pinvaluex">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pinvaluex"></a>
<code>Pin.value([x])</code>
</h4><ul>
<li>不传参数：返回当前引脚电平（0 或 1）。</li>
<li>传参数：写入引脚电平，参数会被转成布尔值（<code>True</code> 置 1，<code>False</code> 置 0）。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="pinon--pinoffpinhigh--pinlow">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pinon--pinoffpinhigh--pinlow"></a>
<code>Pin.on()</code> / <code>Pin.off()</code>、<code>Pin.high()</code> / <code>Pin.low()</code>
</h4><ul>
<li><code>on()</code>、<code>high()</code>：输出高电平（置 1）。</li>
<li><code>off()</code>、<code>low()</code>：输出低电平（置 0）。</li>
</ul>
<p>这四个方法仅对输出/开漏模式有意义。<code>low()</code> / <code>high()</code> 属于非核心 API，在 Pico（rp2）上可用。</p>
<h4 id="pintoggle">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pintoggle"></a>
<code>Pin.toggle()</code>
</h4><p>翻转输出电平，0 变 1、1 变 0。<code>toggle()</code> 在 rp2、esp32 等端口可用；如果某个端口不支持，用 <code>Pin.value(not Pin.value())</code> 代替。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">from</span> <span class="nn">machine</span> <span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">Pin</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span> <span class="nn">time</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">led</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">25</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">OUT</span><span class="p">)</span>   <span class="c1"># Pico 板载 LED 在 GP25</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">while</span> <span class="kc">True</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">led</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">toggle</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">time</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">sleep</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">)</span>        <span class="c1"># 每 1 秒翻转一次</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="pinirqhandlernone-triggerpinirq_falling--pinirq_rising">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pinirqhandlernone-triggerpinirq_falling--pinirq_rising"></a>
<code>Pin.irq(handler=None, trigger=Pin.IRQ_FALLING | Pin.IRQ_RISING)</code>
</h4><p>配置外部中断。电平变化时自动调用回调函数。</p>
<ul>
<li><code>handler</code>：中断回调函数，<strong>必须接收一个 <code>Pin</code> 参数</strong>。</li>
<li><code>trigger</code>：触发条件，可用 <code>|</code> 组合：</li>
</ul>
<table>
	<thead>
			<tr>
					<th>常量</th>
					<th>含义</th>
			</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
			<tr>
					<td><code>Pin.IRQ_FALLING</code></td>
					<td>下降沿</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>Pin.IRQ_RISING</code></td>
					<td>上升沿</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>Pin.IRQ_LOW_LEVEL</code></td>
					<td>低电平</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>Pin.IRQ_HIGH_LEVEL</code></td>
					<td>高电平</td>
			</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">on_press</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">pin</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;按键被按下&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">button</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">15</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">IN</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">PULL_UP</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">button</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">irq</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">handler</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">on_press</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">trigger</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">Pin</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">IRQ_FALLING</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="pwm-类">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pwm-%e7%b1%bb"></a>
PWM 类
</h3><p>PWM（脉冲宽度调制）通过快速开关来模拟中间的电压值，常用于调光、调速、舵机控制。</p>
<h4 id="machinepwmpin-freq-duty_u16">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#machinepwmpin-freq-duty_u16"></a>
<code>machine.PWM(pin, freq=..., duty_u16=...)</code>
</h4><p>在指定引脚上创建 PWM 输出，<code>pin</code> 是 <code>Pin</code> 对象。</p>
<h4 id="常用方法">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%b8%b8%e7%94%a8%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95"></a>
常用方法
</h4><table>
	<thead>
			<tr>
					<th>方法</th>
					<th>作用</th>
			</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
			<tr>
					<td><code>PWM.freq([value])</code></td>
					<td>读取/设置频率，单位 Hz，范围约 8 Hz – 62.5 MHz（CPU 125 MHz 时）</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>PWM.duty_u16([value])</code></td>
					<td>读取/设置占空比，取值 <strong>0–65535</strong>，代表 <code>value / 65535</code> 的比例</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>PWM.duty_ns([value])</code></td>
					<td>读取/设置一个周期内的高电平时长，单位 ns</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td><code>PWM.deinit()</code></td>
					<td>关闭 PWM 输出</td>
			</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p>注意 <code>duty_u16</code> 的上限是 <strong>65535</strong>，不是 65536。地址 65536 会溢出。</p>
</blockquote>
<p>RP2040 有 8 组独立的 PWM 切片，每组 2 个通道，共 16 路。同一组的两个通道<strong>必须共用频率</strong>，但可以有不同占空比。</p>
<h4 id="例呼吸灯">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%be%8b%e5%91%bc%e5%90%b8%e7%81%af"></a>
例：呼吸灯
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">from</span> <span class="nn">machine</span> <span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">PWM</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span> <span class="nn">time</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">led</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">PWM</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Pin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">25</span><span class="p">))</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">led</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">freq</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">1000</span><span class="p">)</span>      <span class="c1"># 1 kHz</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">duty</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span>            <span class="c1"># 占空比百分比</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">step</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">1</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">while</span> <span class="kc">True</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">duty</span> <span class="o">+=</span> <span class="n">step</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">duty</span> <span class="o">&gt;=</span> <span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">duty</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">100</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">step</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">duty</span> <span class="o">&lt;=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">duty</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">step</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">1</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="c1"># 百分比换算成 0-65535，注意别越界</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">led</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">duty_u16</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">int</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">duty</span> <span class="o">/</span> <span class="mi">100</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="mi">65535</span><span class="p">))</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">duty</span> <span class="o">%</span> <span class="mi">5</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">duty</span><span class="p">)</span>  <span class="c1"># 方便绘图观察</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">time</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">sleep</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mf">0.01</span><span class="p">)</span>  <span class="c1"># 约 2 秒一个来回</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="例按键点灯含软件消抖">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%be%8b%e6%8c%89%e9%94%ae%e7%82%b9%e7%81%af%e5%90%ab%e8%bd%af%e4%bb%b6%e6%b6%88%e6%8a%96"></a>
例：按键点灯（含软件消抖）
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">from</span> <span class="nn">machine</span> <span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">Pin</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span> <span class="nn">time</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">button</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">15</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">IN</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">PULL_UP</span><span class="p">)</span>   <span class="c1"># 按下时读到 0</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">led_board</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">25</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">OUT</span><span class="p">)</span>            <span class="c1"># 板载 LED</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">led_ext</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">16</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">Pin</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">OUT</span><span class="p">)</span>              <span class="c1"># 外接 LED</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">while</span> <span class="kc">True</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">led_ext</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">off</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">button</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">value</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">:</span>             <span class="c1"># 可能按下</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">time</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">sleep</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mf">0.01</span><span class="p">)</span>                <span class="c1"># 等 10 ms 再确认，滤掉抖动</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">button</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">value</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">:</span>         <span class="c1"># 确认按下</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="n">led_board</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">toggle</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="n">led_ext</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">on</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;The button is pressed.&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="k">while</span> <span class="n">button</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">value</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">:</span>  <span class="c1"># 等待松手</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">                <span class="n">time</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">sleep</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mf">0.01</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p>机械按键在按下和松开的瞬间会产生毫秒级的电平抖动，被 CPU 读成多次按键。<strong>软件消抖</strong>的做法是：检测到按下后延时 10 ms 再确认一次。</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="adc-类">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#adc-%e7%b1%bb"></a>
ADC 类
</h3><p>ADC（模数转换）把模拟电压转成数字量。</p>
<h4 id="machineadcid">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#machineadcid"></a>
<code>machine.ADC(id)</code>
</h4><p><code>id</code> 可以是 <code>Pin</code> 对象，也可以是通道号：</p>
<ul>
<li>Pico 上通道 <strong>0–3 对应 GP26–GP29</strong>（GP29 板载接 VSYS）；</li>
<li>通道 <strong>4</strong> 是芯片内置温度传感器，可用 <code>ADC.CORE_TEMP</code> 表示。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="adcread_u16">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#adcread_u16"></a>
<code>ADC.read_u16()</code>
</h4><p>读取转换结果，返回 <strong>0–65535</strong> 的整数，对应电压范围 0–3.3 V。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">from</span> <span class="nn">machine</span> <span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">ADC</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">Pin</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">adc</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">ADC</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Pin</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">26</span><span class="p">))</span>          <span class="c1"># 也可以写成 ADC(0)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">value</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">adc</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">read_u16</span><span class="p">()</span>      <span class="c1"># 0 - 65535</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">voltage</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">value</span> <span class="o">/</span> <span class="mi">65535</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="mf">3.3</span>   <span class="c1"># 换算成电压</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">voltage</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">&#34;V&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p>注意量程是 0–65535。RP2040 的 ADC 硬件本身是 12 位（0–4095），MicroPython 把它线性拉伸到 16 位，所以末尾几位没有实际精度。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="小结">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%b0%8f%e7%bb%93"></a>
小结
</h2><table>
	<thead>
			<tr>
					<th>场景</th>
					<th>关键点</th>
			</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
			<tr>
					<td>数字输入输出</td>
					<td><code>Pin(id, mode, pull)</code>，输入用 <code>value()</code> 读，输出用 <code>value()</code> / <code>on()</code> / <code>off()</code> / <code>toggle()</code></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>中断</td>
					<td><code>Pin.irq(handler, trigger)</code>，回调必须带一个 <code>Pin</code> 参数</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>调光/调速</td>
					<td><code>PWM(pin)</code> + <code>freq()</code> + <code>duty_u16()</code>，占空比上限 65535</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>读模拟量</td>
					<td><code>ADC(Pin(26))</code> + <code>read_u16()</code>，返回 0–65535</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>按键抖动</td>
					<td>检测到变化后延时 10 ms 再确认</td>
			</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

        
